OL,3,GNEWSABereaved parents warn of infection
OL,4,Arisk for babies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a newborn baby who died
OL,7,Ffrom catastrophic brain damage caused
OL,8,Fby an infection are urging others to
OL,9,Flearn the signs of serious illness.
OL,11,FEzrah Pollard was 19 days old when he
OL,12,Fcontracted Group B Strep (GBS), a
OL,13,Fbacterial disease that can be passed on
OL,14,Fby close physical contact with
OL,15,Fnewborns.
OL,17,FHis mum Sarah Doolin said: "If other
OL,18,Fparents hear our story and can then
OL,19,Fhelp their baby - that's the best
OL,20,Fpossible legacy for Ezrah."
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
